"armor-mods\t抗性\t胸甲":"<p>对<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>获得 15% ｜ 25% ｜ 30% 伤害抗性。<br> <br> <span class=\"note\">元素抗性模组只减免与该元素匹配的伤害。</span><br> <span class=\"note\">狙击抗性模组减免 30 米以外的伤害。</span><br> <span class=\"note\">近战抗性模组减免 5 米以内的伤害。</span><br> <span class=\"note\">模组「震荡阻尼器」减免范围、冲击与爆炸伤害。</span><br> <br> <span class=\"note\">不同抗性模组之间、抗性与其他减伤来源之间一律乘算叠加。</span></p>",
"armor-mods\t拳到力来\t头盔":"<p>用充能近战击杀时：<br> 额外提供<span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>。<br> <br> 击杀目标提供的<span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>（插 1 ｜ 2 ｜ 3 枚）：<br> T1 <span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span><br> T2 <span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<span class=\"unsure\">1.33%?</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span><br> T3 <span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span><br> T4 <span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>：<span class=\"unsure\">5?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span><br> <span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span>：<span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span> ｜ <span class=\"unsure\">?%</span><br> <br> <span class=\"note\">不与护甲模组「点尸成金」同时生效。</span></p>",
"armor-mods\t时间膨胀\t职业物品":"<p>带有衰减效果的<span class=\"armor-charge\">护甲充能</span>衰减间隔延长：<br> 每 15 ｜ 18 ｜ 20 秒衰减一层。<br> <br> <span class=\"note\">默认情况下，装备衰减类模组时每 10 秒消耗一层护甲充能。</span></p>",
"armor-mods\t特殊武器弹药搜寻者\t头盔":"<p><span class=\"ammo-special\">特殊弹药</span>搜寻者：<br> 弹药进度倍率为 1.25× ｜ 1.4× ｜ 1.5×。<br> <br> <span class=\"ammo-heavy\">威能弹药</span>搜寻者：<br> 弹药进度倍率为 1.25× ｜ 1.4× ｜ 1.5×。</p>",
"armor-mods\t特殊终结技\t职业物品":"<p>使用<span class=\"enemy\">终结技</span>，消耗 <span class=\"armor-charge\">×3 护甲充能</span>：<br> 为<span class=\"enemy\">自己</span>与<span class=\"enemy\">盟友</span>生成一块<span class=\"ammo-special\">特殊弹药</span>。</p>",
