"elements/arc\t电荷思维\t星相":"<p class=\"v\">碎片槽</p><p><span class=\"cond\"><span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>技能击杀或消灭受<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span><span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>影响的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>时：</span><br>生成一枚<span class=\"el-arc\">离子轨迹</span>（生成冷却 <span class=\"unsure\">1?</span> 秒）。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">拾取<span class=\"el-arc\">离子轨迹</span>时：</span><br>为<span class=\"enemy\">自己</span>提供<span class=\"el-arc\">增幅</span>。</p>",
