"elements/arc\t组合打击\t近战技能":"<p class=\"v\">基础冷却 58.1 秒回复倍率 1.0×</p><p><span class=\"cond\">近战击杀时：</span><br>返还 100% <span class=\"pickup\">职业技能能量</span>，恢复 100 <span class=\"health\">生命值</span>，并获得 <span class=\"stack\">1 层</span>「<span class=\"el-arc\">组合打击</span>」，持续 20 秒，最多叠加 <span class=\"stack\">3 层</span>。<br>激活期间基础近战攻击转换为<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>灌注伤害。</p><p><span class=\"note\">配合赌徒闪身全额返还充能需达到 70 职业属性。</span></p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">各层加成效果：</span><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"stack\">1 层</span>：近战伤害 +133% <span class=\"pvp\">[23%]</span> ｜ 击杀恢复 80 <span class=\"health\">生命值</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"stack\">2 层</span>：近战伤害 +266% <span class=\"pvp\">[51.3%]</span> ｜ 击杀恢复 60 <span class=\"health\">生命值</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"stack\">3 层</span>：近战伤害 +400% <span class=\"pvp\">[86%]</span> ｜ 击杀恢复 40 <span class=\"health\">生命值</span></div></div>",
"elements/arc\t裂空打击\t星相":"<p class=\"v\">碎片槽</p><p><span class=\"cond\">击杀受<span class=\"deb-arc\">震颤</span>影响的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>时：</span><br>提供 <span class=\"stack\">1 层</span><span class=\"el-arc\">电光充能</span>（不与神器特性「<span class=\"art-perk\">电介质</span>」叠加）。</p><p><span class=\"cond\">滑铲时按［近战技能］：</span><br>打出上勾拳，沿地面向前释放最远 22 米的<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>波形，造成 739 <span class=\"pvp\">[125]</span> 伤害并施加<span class=\"deb-arc\">震颤</span>。<br>施放后对<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>获得 75% 伤害抗性，持续 <span class=\"unsure\">4?</span> 秒。<br>可触发星相「<span class=\"el-arc\">组合打击</span>」并享受其伤害加成（不与近战「<span class=\"el-arc\">迷失一击</span>」联动）。</p><p><span class=\"note\">开火状态下滑铲无法施放。</span></p>",
"elements/arc\t重击\t星相":"<p class=\"v\">碎片槽</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">近战击杀时：</span><br>在 0.1 秒内快速恢复一段<span class=\"health\">生命值</span>，触发持续恢复，并为<span class=\"enemy\">自己</span>赋予<span class=\"el-arc\">增幅</span>：<div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"bar-red\">红血</span>：恢复 50 <span class=\"health\">生命值</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"bar-orange\">橙血</span>：恢复 75 <span class=\"health\">生命值</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"bar-yellow\">初级首领</span>及以上：恢复 100 <span class=\"health\">生命值</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"bar-orange\">守护者</span>：恢复 30 <span class=\"health\">生命值</span></div></div><p><span class=\"cond\">击破护盾或伤害重伤目标（<span class=\"health\">生命值</span>低于 30%）时：</span><br>获得「<span class=\"el-arc\">重击</span>」，持续 6 秒。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\"><span class=\"el-arc\">重击</span>加成效果：</span><div class=\"bul\">・基础与偃月近战伤害：+160% <span class=\"pvp\">[30%]</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・充能近战伤害：+160% <span class=\"pvp\">[20%]</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・近战突进距离：对<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>提高至 6 米</div><div class=\"bul\">・攻击属性转换：基础近战攻击计为<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>充能近战命中</div></div>",
