"elements/strand\t丝线打击\t超能技能":"<p class=\"v\">T2 级超能基础冷却 556 秒</p><p>伤害抗性：90% <span class=\"pvp\">[45%]</span> ｜ 基础持续：24.5 秒（或每秒消耗 4% <span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>）</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">攻击招式：</span><div class=\"bul\">・轻攻击（消耗 4% <span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>）：命中造成 1638 <span class=\"pvp\">[260]</span> 伤害；击杀使目标爆炸，对 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内的<span class=\"enemy\">敌方目标</span>造成最高 1293 <span class=\"pvp\">[</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span><span class=\"pvp\">]</span> 伤害。</div><div class=\"bul\">・重击（消耗 9% <span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>）：360° 旋挥绳镖，每次使用命中两段，每段在 <span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 米内造成 504 <span class=\"pvp\">[80]</span> 伤害。</div></div><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">技能动作：</span><div class=\"bul\">・手雷技能（不消耗<span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>）：等同于落地后立即恢复充能的「<span class=\"el-strand\">抓钩</span>」手雷。</div><div class=\"bul\">・职业技能（消耗 4.5% <span class=\"orb\">超能能量</span>）：施放超能「<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>法杖」的闪避动作规避攻击。</div></div>",
