"weapon-perks\t二元轨道\t武器 PERK":"<p><span class=\"cond\">造成对立阵营属性击杀时：</span><br>伤害提高 25%，持续 8.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑10.5</span> 秒。<br>再次以对立阵营来源击杀可刷新持续时间；后台可触发，收枪后保留。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">对立阵营触发对应：</span><div class=\"bul\">・光明击杀（<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>／<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>／<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>）：赋予黑暗与动能武器（<span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>／<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>／<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>）</div><div class=\"bul\">・黑暗与动能击杀（<span class=\"el-kinetic\">动能</span>／<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>／<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>）：赋予光明武器（<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>／<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>／<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>）</div></div>",
"weapon-perks\t切割\t武器 PERK":"<p><span class=\"cond\">使用职业技能时：</span><br>此后 8 <span class=\"enh\">↑9</span> 秒内，接下来 5 次命中对未被<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>的目标施加<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>。<br>对未被<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>的目标造成伤害可刷新持续时间；后台可触发，收枪后保留。<br><span class=\"note\">若造成伤害的那发直接击杀目标，则不消耗层数；可对免疫伤害的目标施加割裂。</span></p>",
"weapon-perks\t急切刀锋\t武器 PERK":"<p><span class=\"cond\">切出刀剑时：</span><br>3 秒内单次突进挥砍距离提高 80% <span class=\"enh\">↑100%</span>（空中突进距离降低 20%）。<br>效果结束后进入 3 秒冷却；收枪后移除。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t战嚎炮管\t武器 PERK":"<p><span class=\"cond\">造成近战伤害时：</span><br>接下来 5 秒内的前 3 发子弹伤害提高 50%，并获得 +30 <span class=\"enh\">↑+35</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 操控性、+30<span class=\"unsure\">?</span> <span class=\"enh\">↑+35</span><span class=\"unsure\">?</span> 填装速度；收枪移除。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t狂乱\t武器 PERK":"<p><span class=\"cond\">持续交战满 12 秒（每 5 <span class=\"enh\">↑5.5</span> 秒内保持造成或受到伤害）时：</span><br>伤害提高 15%，+100 操控性、+100 填装速度，持续 7 秒。<br>造成或受到伤害可刷新持续时间；后台可触发，收枪后保留。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t盗墓者\t武器 PERK":"<p><span class=\"cond\">造成充能近战伤害或取得近战击杀时：</span><br>填满弹匣（弹匣填充有 3 秒冷却）。</p><p><span class=\"enh\">↑</span>被动提供 +5 操控性。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t聚合充能\t武器 PERK":"<p><span class=\"cond\">对受元素<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>影响的<span class=\"enemy\">战斗人员</span>造成伤害时：</span><br>伤害提高 10% <span class=\"enh\">↑11%</span> ｜ 20% <span class=\"enh\">↑22%</span> ｜ 30% <span class=\"enh\">↑33%</span>。<br>加成随目标身上不同<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>数量递增，达 3 种不同<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>时达到上限。</p><div class=\"p\"><span class=\"cond\">计入的不同元素<span class=\"debuff\">减益</span>：</span><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-arc\">电弧</span>：<span class=\"deb-arc\">致盲</span>、<span class=\"deb-arc\">震颤</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-solar\">烈日</span>：<span class=\"deb-solar\">灼烧</span>、<span class=\"deb-solar\">点燃</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-void\">虚空</span>：<span class=\"deb-void\">压制</span>、<span class=\"deb-void\">不稳定</span>、<span class=\"deb-void\">虚弱</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-stasis\">冰影</span>：<span class=\"deb-stasis\">减速</span>、<span class=\"deb-stasis\">冻结</span>、<span class=\"deb-stasis\">碎裂</span></div><div class=\"bul\">・<span class=\"el-strand\">缚丝</span>：<span class=\"deb-strand\">割裂</span>、<span class=\"deb-strand\">悬停</span>、<span class=\"deb-strand\">瓦解</span></div></div>",
"weapon-perks\t自动填装枪套\t武器 PERK":"<p><span class=\"cond\">收枪 3.5 <span class=\"enh\">↑3.3</span> 秒后：</span><br>填满弹匣（不触发 Perk「<span class=\"perk\">杀戮弹匣</span>」等填装类效果）。</p>",
"weapon-perks\t金中藏弹\t武器 PERK":"<p><span class=\"cond\">拾取<span class=\"ammo-heavy\">威能弹药</span>块时：</span><br>获得 25% <span class=\"enh\">↑35%</span> 的<span class=\"ammo-special\">特殊弹药</span>备弹（双特殊武器配置时各自减半至 12.5% <span class=\"enh\">↑17.5%</span>）。<br>后台可触发，收枪后生效。</p>",
